# With three players the Jar still reaches "each player": the hands of Bot1 (a Mountain and the Swamp it drew first), Bot2 (seven Islands) and Bot3 (seven Plains) are exiled face down (Bot1 also drew a Swamp for the turn: 16 cards) and each draws seven cards; at the end step all three discard those
